OPENAI_API_KEY=
COMP_AGENT_LIVE_SEARCH=1
COMP_AGENT_OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5
COMP_AGENT_OPENAI_TIMEOUT=120
COMP_AGENT_OPENAI_RETRIES=1
COMP_AGENT_RESEARCH_CONCURRENCY=3
COMP_AGENT_FIELD_REPAIR_LIMIT=4

# --- Config file resolution (src/comp_agent/config.py) ----------------------
# The keys above can also come from a config file instead of this .env.
# Lookup order, first hit wins per key (process env vars always win):
#   1. COMP_AGENT_CONFIG - explicit path to a JSON or .env-style config file.
#      When set, it replaces the shared network default lookup (item 3).
#   2. comp_agent.config.json, then comp_agent.env, next to the app
#      (the executable folder when packaged; the working directory in dev).
#   3. \\datafiles\reference\28_AI\Comparative Projects Deck Generator\API Key, then
#      comp_agent.env beside it - the shared office default. Always the UNC
#      path, never the X: drive letter. Probed with a short timeout so an
#      unreachable share never hangs startup.
#   4. This repo-local .env (dev fallback).
# JSON config files are a flat object of string keys/values, e.g.
#   {"OPENAI_API_KEY": "...", "COMP_AGENT_LIVE_SEARCH": "1"}
# COMP_AGENT_CONFIG=
